:: MP Job Cafe Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCafeEncounter to 1>>
靠窗三号桌的老乐手今天来得比平时早，旧琴盒靠在椅背上，摊开的乐谱压着半块柠檬司康。他起身试音时手杖带翻了托盘，滚烫的红茶正往乐谱和琴盒缝隙里淌。报社记者已经掏出小本子，等位的挑剔常客也皱着眉往这边看。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-cafe-enc">
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<link "抢护湿乐谱 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你一把抽走乐谱，用干净餐巾把纸页一张张隔开吸水，又拿后厨的干布裹住琴盒边角，不让茶汤渗进绒衬。老乐手戴上眼镜逐页翻过，说这段谱子还能看清，临走把赏钱压在杯垫底下。<span class="green">三号桌的乐谱和琴盒都保住了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	茶汤已经浸透两页高音谱，纸边一碰就卷。你越擦越花，老乐手沉默地把琴盒扣上，记者在本子上写了一行。<span class="red">这段谱子只能重抄了。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抢护湿乐谱 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抢护湿乐谱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 220>><<link "温言安抚常客 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你先把三号桌边的椅子拉开，请等位的客人先去露台，又轻声跟老乐手聊起他年轻时在码头乐队吹的曲子。他脸色缓下来，索性合上本子，说茶渍不要紧，还让记者把这段写进明日的市井专栏。<span class="green">三号桌重新安静下来，记者也收起了笔。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_cafe_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 480>><</if>>
	<<seductionskill 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你话还没说完，老乐手已经拎起琴盒起身，记者合上本子跟着走了。挑剔的常客在原地等得不耐烦，敲了敲杯沿。<span class="red">窗边空出一桌没人收拾的狼藉。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[温言安抚常客 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "温言安抚常客">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "换桌重摆茶点 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-cafe-enc">>
你把湿透的餐巾收走，重新铺好桌布，又替老乐手换了一壶温热的红茶。他摆摆手说今天不坐了，琴盒提走时还朝你点了点头。<span class="teal">这一阵忙乱总算没闹大。</span><<stress -1>><<tiredness -1>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:08)|Ocean Breeze]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Farm Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobFarmEncounter to 1>>
磨坊主的板车陷在河湾那条泥路里，车上是等着送进海风咖啡馆后厨的头茬红麦。他踩着车辕催得急，说再拖过半刻就要误了午市的第一炉面包。挽马被泥水溅得直打响鼻，最上面两袋麦子已经滑到车沿。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-farm-enc">
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<link "垫石推车出泥 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把车辕下的泥一锹锹刨开，塞进碎石和干草捆垫住车轮，再抵着车尾一声吆喝。挽马挣了两下，板车终于从泥坑里挪到硬土上。磨坊主跳下车拍了拍你的肩，按加急的脚力钱结了账。<span class="green">头茬红麦赶在午市前出了泥路。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 600>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	碎石没垫稳，车轮一沉又陷回去，溅起的泥点糊了你一身。磨坊主沉着脸让你先把散落的麦袋码回车上。<span class="red">车辕歪了，只得重新卸车。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回农场 (0:08)|Farmland]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[垫石推车出泥 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "垫石推车出泥">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<link "卸麦重码车板 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把车板上的麦袋一袋袋卸下过秤，受潮最重的两袋挑出来单独摊在棚下通风，其余重新码紧压实。磨坊主捏了捏干爽的麦粒，点头让车把式先送去咖啡馆后厨。<span class="green">车上的头茬红麦重新码稳了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_farm_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 460>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	麦袋在湿车板上越码越滑，最上面一袋破口洒了半地。磨坊主蹲下去捧起混了泥的麦粒，脸色不太好看。<span class="red">这趟送货的斤两短了一截。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回农场 (0:08)|Farmland]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[卸麦重码车板 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "卸麦重码车板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link "清点剩余麦袋 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-farm-enc">>
你先把完好的麦袋挪到干棚里码好，再数了一遍斤两，记在磨坊主的账板上。车把式自己去找人抬车，你没再多插手。<span class="teal">这趟只算搭了把手。</span><<stress -1>><<tiredness -1>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回农场 (0:08)|Farmland]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Farm]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
</div>
